text{F}$ | $\\text{T}$ | $\\text{T}$ |\n\nNow, we add a column for $(A∨¬B)⇒A.$ This statement is true unless $A∨¬B$ is true and $A$ is false.\n\n| $\\,A\\,$ | $\\,B\\,$ | $\\,¬B\\,$ | $\\,A∨¬B\\,$ | $\\,(A∨¬B)⇒A\\,$ |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- | --- |\n| $\\text{T}$ | $\\text{T}$ | $\\text{F}$ | $\\text{T}$ | $\\text{T}$ |\n| $\\text{T}$ | $\\text{F}$ | $\\text{T}$ | $\\text{T}$ | $\\text{T}$ |\n| $\\text{F}$ | $\\text{T}$ | $\\text{F}$ | $\\text{F}$ | $\\text{T}$ |\n| $\\text{F}$ | $\\text{F}$ | $\\text{T}$ | $\\text{T}$ | $\\text{F}$ |" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate :question/answer-fields ["answer-field-f9fa52e5-3999-5ad2-a160-80d37215a272" "answer-field-c726fe8a-38ed-5805-90b1-16235366a1af" "answer-field-b31cbfe7-95ac-5f67-8f1d-5d51abea5b50" "answer-field-5d4ec4e7-7a63-5b52-8647-b0ddf5e1d6b7"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id "answer-field-f9fa52e5-3999-5ad2-a160-80d37215a272" :answer-field/id #uuid "f9fa52e5-3999-5ad2-a160-80d37215a272" :answer-field/key "field-1" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/select :answer-field/correct "answer-d0cd3777-1f31-5905-bdb8-443a02182673" :answer-field/choices ["answer-e7561749-77d5-5771-9d53-020a40c1dbfd" "answer-d0cd3777-1f31-5905-bdb8-443a02182673"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "answer-e7561749-77d5-5771-9d53-020a40c1dbfd" :answer/id #uuid "e7561749-77d5-5771-9d53-020a40c1dbfd" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\text{F}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-d0cd3777-1f31-5905-bdb8-443a02182673" :answer/id #uuid "d0cd3777-1f31-5905-bdb8-443a02182673" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\text{T}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-field-c726fe8a-38ed-5805-90b1-16235366a1af" :answer-field/id #uuid "c726fe8a-38ed-5805-90b1-16235366a1af" :answer-field/key "field-2" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/select :answer-field/correct "answer-4b6b923d-3610-529e-a0f7-1a9be98f3bed" :answer-field/choices ["answer-1aff7c0b-d483-5d84-adb6-0cb540cf