/problem "Express $\\sqrt{\\frac{5}{a+b}}\\,$ without radicals in the denominator." :question/worked-solution "First, we apply the quotient rule and put the numerator and denominator under separate radicals:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\sqrt{\\frac{5}{a+b}} & =\\frac{\\sqrt{5}}{\\sqrt{a+b}}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTo remove the radical $\\sqrt{a+b}$ from the denominator, we multiply both the numerator and denominator by $\\sqrt{a+b}$ and simplify:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\frac{\\sqrt{5}}{\\sqrt{a+b}} & = \\\\ \\frac{\\sqrt{5}}{\\sqrt{a+b}}\\cdot \\frac{\\sqrt{a+b}}{\\sqrt{a+b}} & = \\\\ \\frac{\\sqrt{5}\\cdot \\sqrt{a+b}}{\\sqrt{a+b}\\cdot \\sqrt{a+b}} & = \\\\ \\frac{\\sqrt{5(a+b)}}{(\\sqrt{a+b})^{2}} & = \\\\ \\frac{\\sqrt{5(a+b)}}{a+b} & \\end{aligned}\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/hard :question/answer-fields ["answer-field-39c3806c-d499-553b-a0be-7c5643b8cfe0"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id "answer-field-39c3806c-d499-553b-a0be-7c5643b8cfe0" :answer-field/id #uuid "39c3806c-d499-553b-a0be-7c5643b8cfe0" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio :answer-field/correct "answer-a26f3e02-92d3-5d1f-b928-01b20bb52ebf" :answer-field/choices ["answer-b1dd8cac-e702-5ca8-9e50-f2b488451c81" "answer-0ae8dd84-1056-5afc-bdc6-13595c3ec750" "answer-a26f3e02-92d3-5d1f-b928-01b20bb52ebf" "answer-5ddd2e2e-8471-56e7-a9d7-6310c3988ee4" "answer-0f075ce4-fb79-5eda-ae39-63d67635fa33"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "answer-b1dd8cac-e702-5ca8-9e50-f2b488451c81" :answer/id #uuid "b1dd8cac-e702-5ca8-9e50-f2b488451c81" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\frac{5\\sqrt{a+b}}{a+b}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-0ae8dd84-1056-5afc-bdc6-13595c3ec750" :answer/id #uuid "0ae8dd84-1056-5afc-bdc6-13595c3ec750" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\frac{\\sqrt{5(a+b)}}{5(a+b)}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-a26f3e02-92d3-5d1f-b928-01b20bb52ebf" :answer/id #uuid "a26f3e02-92d3-5d1f