The statement $B∨A$ is true if either $A$ is true, $B$ is true, or both $A$ and $B$ are true.\n\n| $\\,A\\,$ | $\\,B\\,$ | $\\,B∨A\\,$ |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| $\\text{T}$ | $\\text{T}$ | $\\text{T}$ |\n| $\\text{T}$ | $\\text{F}$ | $\\text{T}$ |\n| $\\text{F}$ | $\\text{T}$ | $\\text{T}$ |\n| $\\text{F}$ | $\\text{F}$ | $\\text{F}$ |\n\nThen, we look at the columns labeled $A$ and $B∨A$ to complete the column $A∨(B∨A).$ The statement $A∨(B∨A)$ is true if either $A$ is true, $B∨A$ is true, or both $A$ and $B∨A$ are true. \n\nThe completed truth table is shown below:\n\n| $\\,A\\,$ | $\\,B\\,$ | $\\,B∨A\\,$ | $\\,A∨(B∨A)\\,$ |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- |\n| $\\text{T}$ | $\\text{T}$ | $\\text{T}$ | $\\text{T}$ |\n| $\\text{T}$ | $\\text{F}$ | $\\text{T}$ | $\\text{T}$ |\n| $\\text{F}$ | $\\text{T}$ | $\\text{T}$ | $\\text{T}$ |\n| $\\text{F}$ | $\\text{F}$ | $\\text{F}$ | $\\text{F}$ |" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy :question/answer-fields ["answer-field-32f6e1d4-6ba4-5d0b-9fe3-4dcf08d713bd" "answer-field-56d3a182-3093-5f51-a361-e65fbf7331a6" "answer-field-cc3c06af-6aaa-5361-a533-ff64aa51aaac" "answer-field-d5753e60-71b4-5a88-a4f9-ba1fa8dc2043"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id "answer-field-32f6e1d4-6ba4-5d0b-9fe3-4dcf08d713bd" :answer-field/id #uuid "32f6e1d4-6ba4-5d0b-9fe3-4dcf08d713bd" :answer-field/key "field-1" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/select :answer-field/correct "answer-359ddfb8-637d-5027-a2b7-a7628411b606" :answer-field/choices ["answer-00e08e19-2567-56d3-af2f-cb1b1327fd38" "answer-359ddfb8-637d-5027-a2b7-a7628411b606"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "answer-00e08e19-2567-56d3-af2f-cb1b1327fd38" :answer/id #uuid "00e08e19-2567-56d3-af2f-cb1b1327fd38" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\text{F}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-359ddfb8-637d-5027-a2b7-a7628411b606" :answer/id #uuid "359ddfb8-637d-5027-a2b7-a7628411b606" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\text{T}" :db/en